Subject: [PATCH 4/5] sweet: camera: Implement torch strength control

Drive both PM6150L torch LEDs from the camera-service extension and cap the
reported maximum at 255. The matching sysfs permissions are supplied by the
sm6150-common torch-control patch.
---
