 camera/CameraProviderExtension.cpp | 69 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 device.mk                          |  3 ++
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 camera/Android.bp
 create mode 100644 camera/CameraProviderExtension.cpp

